# EDK2 dialect lives here (see docs/SOURCETREE.md "C dialect") — its house
# style (spread signatures, space-before-call-parens, etc.) is deliberately
# different from the root config and is not something we're auto-formatting
# right now. This makes both `clang-format -i` and editor format-on-save
# no-ops under src/efi/**.
---
DisableFormat: true
